<title>USA: Leon County, Fla., repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Leon County, Fla., repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co., Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Leon County, Fla., $7 million deal, cutting the yields in the 2002 and 2003 maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>LEON COUNTY, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $7,190,000*</p>
<p>CAPITAL IMPROVEMENT REVENUE BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa - AMBAC	 S&amp;P: AAA - AMBAC</p>
<p>DATED: 06/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 10/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>10/01/1997		  205M    4.25  %	  3.70</p>
<p>10/01/1998		  215M    4.25  %	  3.75</p>
<p>10/01/1999		  220M    4.25  %	  4.10</p>
<p>10/01/2000		  230M    4.25  %	  4.25</p>
<p>10/01/2001		  240M    4.30  %	  4.35</p>
<p>10/01/2002		  255M    4.40  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2003		  265M    4.50  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2004		  280M    4.50  %	  4.60</p>
<p>10/01/2005		  295M    4.60  %	  4.65</p>
<p>10/01/2006		  305M    4.70  %	  4.75</p>
<p>10/01/2007		  325M    4.80  %	  4.85</p>
<p>10/01/2008		  340M    4.90  %	  4.95</p>
<p>10/01/2009		  355M    5.00  %	  5.05</p>
<p>10/01/2010		  375M    5.00  %	  5.15</p>
<p>10/01/2011		  395M    5.10  %	  5.20</p>
<p>10/01/2012		  420M    5.125 %	  5.25</p>
<p>10/01/2017		2,470M    5.25  %	 97.25</p>
<p>					  (Approx. Yield 5.476%)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 10/1/07  101%, DECLINING TO 100% 10/1/09</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Tuesday, June 10, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on July 2, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Pryor, McClendon, Counts &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
